// undefined); local list attempted with timeout min(timeoutMs, 5000),
// errors swallowed; remote GET `${OMNIROUTE_FREE_BASE_URL}/models` with
// applyOpenCodeHeaders applied; non-ok -> remoteError; combined = remote
// when non-empty else local (live catalog is authoritative); when both
